---
source: crates/core/tests/arch.rs
expression: summarize(&tasks(&sys))
---
[x] System     arch.pacman-tweaks — Colorful pacman output
[x] System     arch.multilib — Enable the multilib repository
[x] System     system.update — Update the system
[x] Tools      arch.build-tools — Build tools (base-devel, git)
[x] Drivers    gpu.nvidia — NVIDIA driver (open kernel modules)
      note: DKMS also builds the module for linux73-tkg-eevdf, which needs the matching -headers package installed.
[x] Multimedia gpu.nvidia-vaapi — Hardware video decoding on NVIDIA
[x] Tools      arch.paru — AUR helper (paru)
[x] Apps       flatpak.flathub — Flatpak with Flathub
[x] Multimedia media.codecs — Media codecs and thumbnails
[x] Tools      tools.archive — Archive tools
[x] Tools      tools.drives — NTFS and exFAT drives
[x] System     system.fonts — Fonts for every language and emoji
[ ] System     system.ms-fonts — Microsoft core fonts
      note: Built from the AUR; installing them means accepting Microsoft's font license.
[x] System     system.firmware — Firmware updates
[ ] System     system.firewall — Firewall (ufw)
[ ] Debloat    debloat.libreoffice — Remove LibreOffice
